\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Attainability and certificate scope. Left: all ordinary primary targets, with one strict-first definition throughout. Right: equal-seed average support bounds on targets attainable under all three rules at that ceiling. HELM cohort sizes are $(14,13,13)$ at half and $(24,24,24)$ at full headroom; Open LLM sizes are $(18,17,17)$ and $(24,24,24)$. Bars are certification ranges, not statistical intervals; points indicate exact costs. Unlike Figure~\ref {fig:exact}, right-panel cohorts can change across ceilings.}}{6}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:scope}{{3}{6}{Attainability and certificate scope. Left: all ordinary primary targets, with one strict-first definition throughout. Right: equal-seed average support bounds on targets attainable under all three rules at that ceiling. HELM cohort sizes are $(14,13,13)$ at half and $(24,24,24)$ at full headroom; Open LLM sizes are $(18,17,17)$ and $(24,24,24)$. Bars are certification ranges, not statistical intervals; points indicate exact costs. Unlike Figure~\ref {fig:exact}, right-panel cohorts can change across ceilings}{figure.caption.7}{}}
